<Band Id="what-it-is" Topic="What it is" Title="A few lines of your own." Summary="The engine runs the agent's loop. An identity says who the agent is, and a pack what it can do. Your program names them and starts a host, which puts the agent in front of people. This is the coding agent's, as it stands.">
